    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d759-a8">

                <pb facs="0918" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg824"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8 in No.
                    2756.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr.
                            Viondi.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: As you are the advocate of Mr. Julio
                    Sanguily, please inform me the reasons upon which are founded his indictment and
                    imprisonment; and likewise, if I could, legally, obtain a copy of the record of
                    his trial, and of the order of the judge for his indictment and
                    imprisonment.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramon O. Williams</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
